  "allowed_scope": [
    "Genuine tagged frozen U3/U4 root-key fibres, original 70+36 selected rows, same additive prime, Q, physical cutoffs, occurrence multiplicities and original absolute marked Theta.",
    "Exact Gamma5/6 and Gamma7/8 incidences on the original receipt for ordinary good pairs, positive gate rejection and Gamma9--21 stay on the original full raw sources, one collision fee. W1 first-square fee appears once.",
    "Exact signed correction and two independent aggregate upper bounds. The minimum is taken after summation over the complete common fibre. Full-parent route debits its outside mass and its single original rounding term. No incremental positive shell is required to change the current upper mother.",
    "On an actual selected root, the original receipt has a plateau below N^a and no prime divisor in its selected bank window. No winner or nonemptiness presupposed."
  ],
  "withheld": [
    "A uniform small bound on the signed masked lower-singleton net or the remaining model-price difference of the direct route.",
    "Payment of the old full signed predecessor and true switched/base prices on the physical family, or a proof that the minimum of the two aggregate budgets pays the required analytical bound.",
    "One common buffered analytic cap/near-wall estimate across N for moving or unfrozen queries, arbitrary real-Q lower walls, the full Y26 analytical terminal, other tracker responsibilities or H430 adoption."
  ],
